{"games":[{"id":4779613061,"name":"South London 2 🔥","desc":"🔥HUGE UPDATES🔥\n\n💯 1V1 EVENT, HEISTS, NEW CARS, NEW JOBS , IMPROVEMENTS\n\n[PS5] Click your Left Thumbstick Down To open Controller MENU\nPress \"M\" to open your Map in game, on mobile /Map , On controller press the right arrow.\n/GPS in game for easy navigation\n\n🏙️ The City of London gives lots of opportunities to It's citizens.\n\nIn this game, you can become anything your heart desires.\nYou can become a Police Officer, a working business man , a criminal mastermind or just a regular citizen and countless others!\n\nThis game can be used to seek the thrill of stealing huge amounts of cash, making business deals\nand getting opportunities to work at tons of different occupations. And the thrill of next level combat system.\n\n🛠️ DEVELOPERS :\nhttps://www.roblox.com/users/1109656080/profile (Drippy)\nhttps://www.roblox.com/users/1146817910/profile (Clout)\n","path":"/game/4779613061-south-london-2","slug":"4779613061-south-london-2","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/375563f0a4b0a56c6ba27dc7371326807e4ff3038188b68a3689b738abd7a7e4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-98f92b1c50e9b5dab6a8cbf2617deee8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":74523871,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-03-06T03:06:06.158Z","creator":{"name":"FNTDrippy","type":"User"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5656754541,"name":"World Tower Defense [1.18.2]","desc":"A different type of \"Tower Defense\" experience. Defend your base against the onslaught of enemies, but be careful with your money... they can fight back. \n\n1.18.2 adds the Toxic Sewers remake, with a new mode and accessory! There are many other changes, too!\n\n\nDesigns inspired by Tower Battles. \nSome mechanics loosely inspired by Battle Cats. \nCheck the update log for information. \nMore information on recent updates can be found in our server. \n\nWTD!\nNone of the music in this game is created by me. \nCredit goes to where credit is due! Credits menu can be found in the game!\nIf you find cheaters, please report them in our server!\n\nTags: Tower Defense, Tower, Defense, World, TD, War, Battle, Guns, Fighting","path":"/game/5656754541-world-tower-defense","slug":"5656754541-world-tower-defense","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ac43b384c0005f619041ae5fb9a2633b6e38480197fffa954cd594efb06056d2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-fb513bdf1d9ae861cf467a4ee496c424/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":65245769,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-10T16:54:00.007Z","creator":{"name":"Select an Image from Your Computer Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6713610501,"name":"Guess How Many","desc":"Welcome to Guess How Many!\n\nJust a simple little game 😊\nEach round the jar will be filled with a random item 🍭🍬🍪⚽️\nGuess how many items are in the jar to earn coins 🤔❓💰\nUse coins to choose the next item! 💰\nYou can also choose one of many crazy ways for the jar to be filled! \n\nComplete daily challenges to earn awesome rewards.\nUnlock and equip cute Jar pets to follow you around.\n\nFree VIP Servers so have fun with your friends!\n\n👍If you enjoy the game press the like button!\n⭐Don't forget to favorite!\n🙌🏻Join Hidden Power up for updates on the game\n\nThanks so much!\n\nIf you have suggestions or find bugs please let me know.  Thanks!\n","path":"/game/6713610501-guess-how-many","slug":"6713610501-guess-how-many","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/1c848bc1399f47b3d75decc82a53e3db77f5ff75256a0d82f7ca118c60f2260d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-aafa4975956c406d6470a8b21e691946/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":30028491,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-08-17T05:08:21.040Z","creator":{"name":"Hidden Powerup","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5665787539,"name":"Gods Of G